# Header rules for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# GitHub Pages cannot carry these: it has no per-file header control, so an
# extensionless `/.well-known/ucp` is served as application/octet-stream and
# every profile gets `max-age=600` with no `public`. Shopify's fetcher rejects
# both, in that order, with -32001 profile_malformed:
#
#   content-type octet-stream          -> "Invalid content type"
#   cache-control max-age=600 (no public) -> "Invalid cache control"
#
# Measured 11 November 2026 against weareallbirds.myshopify.com, using this
# domain as the advertised agent profile. Shopify's own reference profile sends
# `application/json` and `public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=7200`.

/.well-known/ucp
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/ucp/agent/*
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
